    "special": {
      "value": "You cannot select another dedication feat until you have gained two other feats from the Bellflower tiller archetype.\nLeads to: Cut the Bonds|AoA3, Garden Path|AoA3, Practiced Guidance|AoA3, Scarecrow|AoA3, Tiller's Aid|AoA3, Tiller's Drive|AoA3"
